CM_ SG_ 2600454438 actStateChrgPlug2Disp_BASE "State of the plug connector of the conductive charging interface 2 for display purpose.";
CM_ SG_ 2600454438 actStateChrgPlugDisp_BASE "state of the plug connector of the conductive charging interface for display purpose.";
CM_ SG_ 2600454438 extrnlChrgTargetSOC_HR_BASE "Requested SOC of the traction energy storage.";
CM_ SG_ 2600454438 extrnlChrgTrgtDrvngRngDisp_BASE "The signal indicates the target driving range.";
CM_ SG_ 2600454438 extrnlChrgErrorType_BASE "The signal indicates the active error type of the charging system. Only highest prio error communicated.";
CM_ SG_ 2600454438 extrnlChrgHoldInfImmedDisp_BASE "The signal displays if the holding period for immediate charging is selected to be infinite.";
CM_ SG_ 2600454438 extrnlChrgModeDisp_BASE "The signal indicates the current charging mode.";
CM_ SG_ 2600454438 energyManagmtMenuReq_BASE "Request for activation and selection of the intial menu tab of the energy management menu in the cluster. Remark: This signal is the functional trigger for wakeup of the cluster.";
CM_ SG_ 2600454438 coolantTempCCC_BASE "Coolant temperature for temperature display";
CM_ SG_ 2600454438 extrnlChrgOTActrlDisp_BASE "The signal indicates if control of the charging settings via OTA (over the air) is selected.";
CM_ SG_ 2600454438 extrnlChrgFlapStateChrgI2_BASE "State of the flap of the charging interface 2.";

